{"title":"Get Ready to Launch Your Business: Keep Up the Momentum and Find the Money","startsAt":"2026-11-26T18:00:00-05:00","endsAt":"2026-11-26T20:00:00-05:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"We're wrapping up our 2026 Entrepreneur in Residence program with a final session on launching your business. We'll map the real funding landscape for a new business in Ontario — startup loans, microloans, grants, sponsorship and revenue-based approaches — and cover what each one requires, so you don't waste months applying to the wrong thing. You'll learn how to present your business to a funder, and where to find free ongoing support once the series ends. We'll close with the accountability habits that keep a new business moving.\n\nThe program includes a short networking component, providing participants with an opportunity to connect with other entrepreneurs.\n\nPresented by Ryan Knight, TPL's 2026 [Entrepreneur in Residence](https://tpl.ca/programs-and-classes/featured/entrepreneur-in-residence/) (EIR) at Toronto Reference Library.\n\n**Registration via TPL website:** [https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a99b901d94765189bb97c31](https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a99b901d94765189bb97c31)\n**Drop-ins welcome until room capacity is reached.**\n\nAccessibility\nLive or automated closed captioning, sign language interpretation, intervenor services, or attendant services are available upon request. Please submit your request at least 2 weeks in advance to: [tpl.ca/accessibility-events](https://tpl.ca/accessibility/accessibility-supports/programs-and-events/?_gl=1*v83hy7*_ga*NDk5MDg2NTE1LjE3NjYwMDgxODQ.*_ga_G99DMMNG39*czE3NjkxMDY3NDMkbzE0JGcxJHQxNzY5MTA2ODM0JGozOCRsMCRoMA..).","venue":{"name":"Toronto Public Library - Toronto Reference Library","address":"789 Yonge St, Toronto, ON M4W 2G8, Canada, Toronto","lat":43.671806,"lng":-79.38682,"city":"Toronto"},"fee":null,"group":"Toronto Public Library Small Business Networking Meetup","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/6/b/6/3/highres_536307491.jpeg"}